#: ImplementationPair.md:1
msgid "Implement the pair coordination"
msgstr "Pair Coordination の実装"

#: ImplementationPair.md:3
msgid ""
"See the main [coordination implementation](Implementation.md), the code "
"there is uses as a starting point for this variant."
msgstr "[基本実装](Implementation.md) を基にします。"

#: ImplementationPair.md:5
msgid ""
"This should be the easiest implementation: If each kernel will run only on a"
" couple it could be written like this:"
msgstr "最も簡単な実装として、各 Kernel が1 Pair のみ扱うなら、"

#: ImplementationPair.md:69
msgid ""
"The efficiency of this approach is not high, because we lose time in "
"spinning up `ncouples` of threads, each one that does a single small task, "
"the coordination of a single pair."
msgstr "`ncouples` 個の Thread の起動に時間がかかり、それぞれが1 Pair の小さな計算だけをするので、効率は高くありません。"

#: ImplementationPair.md:71
msgid ""
"An attempt to make it quicker could be to slightly change the kernel with a "
"for loop on some pairs."
msgstr "複数 Pair の For Loop を Kernel に加えると高速化できるかもしれません。"

#: ImplementationPair.md:134
msgid ""
"This kernel works on `couplesPerThread` per thread. The problem with this "
"prototype is that nearly all the operations are done in the global memory."
msgstr ""
"各 Thread は `couplesPerThread` Pair を処理します。ただし、ほぼ全操作が Global Memory "
"上という問題があります。"
